-- tanker-02-chambers-and-invoice.json: 15 Sep challan: 14,000 L HSD, 28 L short, invoice ₹13,88,011. Price = ₹101.74 − ₹2.60 = ₹99.14/L, so the worked-out amount is ₹13,87,960 (₹51 less than the challan). To pay = challan ₹13,88,011 − short ₹2,775.92. Each chamber's rise is its own dip after − dip before on the real chart (diesel sold between chambers 2 and 3); the tanker's total rise is the chambers added up.
  select 'a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000026', (select id from public.dip_charts where pump_id = 'a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000026' and name = 'iocl-20kl'), dip_cm, volume_l from golden_chart_rows where chart = 'iocl-20kl';

